  "bio": "Cody Harris is a bold, conservative leader who has established lasting relationships in the Texas House of Representatives over the last four legislative sessions. He is both proud and grateful to serve the constituents of Texas House District 8 which comprises Anderson, Cherokee, Henderson and Navarro counties. A lifelong Texan, Cody is a 5th generation resident of East Texas where his values were first planted and nourished. His ancestral roots were established in Freestone County just after the Civil War. Along the Trinity River at Cayuga, his great-grandfather served as the last operator of the Wildcat Ferry, and it is that heritage that helps guide his decision making for the prosperity and protection of rural life in Texas. Cody entered the.",
